{
  "providers": [
    {
      "id": "zhipu",
      "name": "智谱 GLM",
      "base_url": "https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4",
      "api_key": "在这里填入你的 API Key",
      "model": "glm-4.6"
    },
    {
      "id": "deepseek",
      "name": "DeepSeek",
      "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1",
      "api_key": "",
      "model": "deepseek-chat"
    }
  ],
  "active_provider": "zhipu",
  "permission_mode": "confirm",
  "shell": "auto",
  "max_output_chars": 20000,
  "max_steps": 40,
  "request_timeout_seconds": 300,
  "turn_time_limit_seconds": 1800,
  "session_token_limit": 0,
  "subagent_time_limit_seconds": 600,
  "subagent_models": {},
  "_说明_subagent_models": "按档位分模型(v0.9.95):{\"explore\": \"模型名\", \"code\": \"模型名\"}。只换模型名、不换供应商;名字必须是当前供应商里已启用的模型,对不上就退回主模型并在那一路的报告里写清为什么退。留空 = 所有档位都用主模型。",
  "feedback_recall": true,
  "context_window": 131072,
  "compact_at_ratio": 0.7,
  "vision": false,
  "sandbox": {
    "enabled": true,
    "allow_outside_workspace": false,
    "allow_network": true,
    "timeout_seconds": 60,
    "deny_patterns": [],
    "strip_env_secrets": true
  },
  "mcp_servers": [
    {
      "id": "filesystem",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem",
        "D:/data"
      ],
      "enabled": false,
      "read_only": false,
      "description": "示例:文件系统 MCP 服务器(需 Node.js;enabled 改 true 即启用)"
    },
    {
      "id": "remote-demo",
      "transport": "http",
      "url": "https://example.com/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "${MY_MCP_TOKEN}"
      },
      "enabled": false,
      "read_only": true,
      "description": "示例:只有网址的 MCP 服务器。transport 可写 http(新式 Streamable HTTP)或 sse(老式 HTTP+SSE),留空则是 command 启动的 stdio 服务器。密钥写成 ${环境变量名},发请求时才展开,不会以明文落进 config.json"
    }
  ],
  "session_keep_last": 0,
  "_说明": "session_keep_last:会话留档保留个数,启动时按时间删旧的;0 = 全部保留(默认)",
  "backup_dir": "",
  "_说明2": "backup_dir:周期自动备份目录(v0.9.98)。填一个存在的或可创建的文件夹路径,每周六上午会把可打包的本机数据(含聊天记录,不含密钥)备份成 zip,保留最近 4 份;留空 = 不备份。跑没跑可问学长「定时任务跑没跑」"
}
